<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soquimich cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soquimich cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analysts Ricardo Fernandez, Pablo Salcedo and Hector Castillo have cut their rating for Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile SA, or Soquimich, to sell from buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 24 report, they wrote, &quot;We believe the stock should not deserve its historical premium to the market in the medium term ....</p>
<p>-- &quot;Changes in market share would cause substantial downward pressure on prices in Chile, hence reducing profitability.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts closed Thursday at 62-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
